# Current starting point

The existing `DocumentProcessingService` already does the right sequence:

1. Loads the stored PDF file.
2. Extracts text with IronPDF.
3. Falls back to IronOCR if embedded text is not useful.
4. Saves raw text to `PortalDocumentContent`.
5. Sets `document.ExtractedTextPreview = CreatePreview(rawText);`
6. Moves the document to `TextExtracted`. 

The important current line is:

```csharp
document.ExtractedTextPreview = CreatePreview(rawText);
```

That is the only Web-layer behavior we need to improve.

